  "body": "Welcome to 18 Settlers Grove, Orewa - an estuary-front residence on one of the area's most established and desirable waterfront settings. Set on an exceptionally generous, flat residential site, this single-level home is a cut above the rest.\r\n\r\nElevated above the Te Ara Tahuna Estuary Cycleway and Walkway, the home captures peaceful water outlooks with waterfront walks, bike rides and the natural beauty of the estuary right at your boundary.\r\n\r\nA welcoming entrance sets the tone for a home of remarkable scale, with space to come together and room to make your own. This home is designed around a lifestyle of family connection and entertaining. At its heart, the kitchen connects everyday family life with effortless entertaining. \r\n\r\nMultiple living spaces provide flexibility for both relaxed everyday living and larger occasions, while the central courtyard and the heated salt water swimming pool create an inviting private setting for summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe large grounds, generous off-street parking and versatile layout will appeal to families needing space to spread out, multi-generational living, work-from-home, and those wanting room for hobbies or music.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a quiet street within the current Orewa College zone, this is a property that combines a prized waterfront lifestyle with the convenience of central Orewa.\r\n\r\nRarely does a home of this calibre, scale and position become available. 18 Settlers Grove is an exceptional opportunity for discerning buyers seeking an enduring family home in a tightly held estuary-front location.\r\n\r\nContact Lane today to arrange your viewing of this impressive waterfront home.\r\n\r\n* Auction Onsite - Thursday 26 November 2026 at 6:30pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo view all available documents please copy and paste the following link:  https://www.propertyfiles.co.nz/property/18Settlers\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
